{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control Cururu, a Brazilian bullfrog from the country\u2019s native fauna, on a spiritual journey to purify a corrupted world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/06eb623e66ce65c6236b1fcc48481a9c.avif?t=1772682703\" width=1171 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deep corruption of the miasma is eroding the minds of mortals and spirits alike. Desperate and alone, one of the forest\u2019s last remaining entities \u2014 <strong>Nai\u00e1, the Giant Water Lily</strong> \u2014 chooses a hero. Now, a young frog must embark on a journey of self-discovery to save the land he calls home before the corruption consumes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cururu: Whispers of the Forest</strong> is a 2D Metroidvania deeply rooted in Brazilian culture. Explore biomes reimagined through a Naturepunk lens, solve puzzles, evolve your abilities, face corrupted animals and spirits, and unlock new paths using the purifying power of water.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 100% Brazilian protagonist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/c02fbd5fdfe7e82c1cb9c4460ebac8b5.poster.avif?t=1772682703\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/c02fbd5fdfe7e82c1cb9c4460ebac8b5.webm?t=1772682703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/c02fbd5fdfe7e82c1cb9c4460ebac8b5.mp4?t=1772682703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a journey into the unknown as Cururu, a bullfrog native to Brazilian forests. Face the mysteries and challenges of each biome with fast, fluid movement, where mastering water powers is the key to success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a reimagined Brazil</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/cbc060dd7c7cd6f34237a46da832c474.poster.avif?t=1772682703\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/cbc060dd7c7cd6f34237a46da832c474.webm?t=1772682703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/cbc060dd7c7cd6f34237a46da832c474.mp4?t=1772682703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>Zootania</strong>, a Naturepunk world full of secrets and fantasy, inspired by biomes such as the Atlantic Forest, the Amazon, and the Cerrado. Each region features living fauna and flora, soundtracks infused with Brazilian rhythms, traditional regional dishes, and a story that celebrates national culture.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Waters that shape the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/2ed0e28c393a52357b8b3f06fdf09878.poster.avif?t=1772682703\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/2ed0e28c393a52357b8b3f06fdf09878.webm?t=1772682703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/2ed0e28c393a52357b8b3f06fdf09878.mp4?t=1772682703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessed with the power of the <strong>Lunar Waters</strong>, uncover the secrets of the past and purify areas overtaken by the Miasma, an ancient evil returning to reclaim control of the world. Overcome challenges, cleanse each region, free its inhabitants, and reconnect with your spiritual side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Allies and enemies from Brazilian folklore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/73b710c4866c7b2d6b82d5b372f79270.poster.avif?t=1772682703\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/73b710c4866c7b2d6b82d5b372f79270.webm?t=1772682703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/73b710c4866c7b2d6b82d5b372f79270.mp4?t=1772682703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter enchanted entities from Brazilian folklore such as <strong>Boitat\u00e1</strong>, <strong>Saci-Perer\u00ea</strong>, and <strong>Curupira</strong> \u2014 ancestral connections to the ancient world that have taken on new forms to maintain balance in Zootania. Inspired by Brazilian wildlife, they are reimagined as spiritual guardians and corrupted creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover, evolve, and purify</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/068ddd295427a0b1f6fe84ab0c408826.poster.avif?t=1772682703\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/068ddd295427a0b1f6fe84ab0c408826.webm?t=1772682703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/068ddd295427a0b1f6fe84ab0c408826.mp4?t=1772682703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect seeds, native fruits, and magical talismans that awaken new abilities and transform the world around you. Each power unlocks new paths to explore and reveals ancient secrets of nature.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spiritual Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/a07ad235bcbfc2e1992d95775639955e.poster.avif?t=1772682703\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/a07ad235bcbfc2e1992d95775639955e.webm?t=1772682703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/extras/a07ad235bcbfc2e1992d95775639955e.mp4?t=1772682703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D adventure about healing, connection, and resilience, developed based on the folktales and regional cultures of each region of Brazil, focused on presenting an original and unique story for players of all ages.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693050?t=1772682703","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693050?t=1772682703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/8589cd35d3b2153362857a44c22c9a8bc2c3cc5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772682703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693050/8589cd35d3b2153362857a44c22c9a8bc2c3cc5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772682703","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"descriptio